{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"一、十有二年。春，薛伯定卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"二、夏，葬薛襄公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"三、叔孫州仇帥師墮郈。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"四、衞公孟彄帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"五、季孫斯、仲孫何忌帥師墮費。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"曷為帥師墮郈？帥師墮費？孔子行乎季孫，三月不違，曰：「家不藏甲，邑無百雉之城。」於是帥師墮郈，帥師墮費。雉者何？五板而堵，五堵而雉，百雉而城。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"六、秋，大雩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"七、冬十月癸亥，公會齊侯盟于黃。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"八、十有一月丙寅朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"九、公至自黃。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_224_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_224","textTraditional":"十、十有二月，公圍成。公至自圍成。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}